      "plain": "pl compares the two pixel by pixel and draws the answer as a picture: blank where they agree, marked where they do not.",
      "technical": "analyse() fits exposure and white balance, then maps CIEDE2000 per pixel; the sheet draws it on a fixed scale, 0 to 20+. A cell here is that map's mean.",
